{"ref":"BDB, מַפֶּ֫לֶת","hw":"מַפֶּ֫לֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַפֶּ֫לֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. carcass, ruin, overthrow</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>carcass</em>, of lion, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> cstr. <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:8\" href=\"/Judges.14.8\">Ju 14:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  elsewhere sf. <strong>a.</strong>  <em>a ruin</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַפַּלְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.13\">Ez 31:13</a> (kg. under fig. of tree). <strong>b.</strong>  <em>overthrow</em>, <em>id.</em> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.16\">16</a> (same fig.); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַפַּלְתֶּ֑ךָ</span> (kg.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.10\">32:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַפַּלְתֵּךְ</span> (of Tyre) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.15\">26:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.27\">27:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַפַּלְתָּם</span> (of wicked) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.16\">Pr 29:16</a>.","next":"BDB, נְפִלִים","prev":"BDB, מַפֵּלָה"}